6191 0 obj
<<
/Title (The threshold selects different tracts depending on the criterion the user chooses, because each criterion has different preferences: prevalence favors small, high-rate tracts, affected population favors large, dense ones, and social vulnerability favors disadvantaged ones. Moving the sliders shows the range of possible selections and how a small change in the cutoff can change which tracts count as high priority.)
